 passion. The pages of this book contain interviews with 70 of the world's most well-known guitarists across musical genres and playing styles to discover how their love of the instrument compelled them to pursue music as a career. These guitar icons reveal how they got their first instrument, the music they loved, and their heroes and inspirations. With an impressive list of subjectsincluding Dick Dale, Melissa Etheridge, Jimmy Page, Les Paul, and Carlos Santanaas well as childhood photos from such guitar legends as Alex Lifeson, Joe Satriani, and Jimmie Vaughan, this book has appeal for guitar heroes and nonmusicians alike.","featured_series":{},"genres":[],"has_audiobook":false,"has_ebook":false,"id":"671861","image":{"color":"#dfdfd8","color_name":"Beige","height":192,"id":721419,"url":"https://assets.hardcover.app/edition/30657625/content.jpeg","width":128},"isbns":["1770903089","9781770903081"],"lists_count":0,"moods":[],"pages":306,"prompts_count":0,"rating":0.0,"ratings_count":0,"release_date":"2012-09-20","release_year":2012,"reviews_count":0,"series_ids":[],"series_names":[],"slug":"red-rising-2012","tags":[],"title":"Red Rising","users_count":1,"users_read_count":0},"highlight":{"alternative_titles":[{"matched_tokens":["Red","Rising"],"snippet":"<mark>Red</mark> <mark>Rising</mark>"}],"title":{"matched_tokens":["Red","Rising"],"snippet":"<mark>Red</mark> <mark>Rising</mark>"}},"highlights":[{"field":"title","matched_tokens":["Red","Rising"],"snippet":"<mark>Red</mark> <mark>Rising</mark>"},{"field":"alternative_titles","indices":[0],"matched_tokens":[["Red","Rising"]],"snippets":["<mark>Red</mark> <mark>Rising</mark>"]}],"text_match":1157451471441625130,"text_match_info":{"best_field_score":"2211897868544","best_field_weight":5,"fields_matched":2,"num_tokens_dropped":0,"score":"1157451471441625130","tokens_matched":2,"typo_prefix_score":0}},{"document":{"activities_count":4453,"alternative_titles":["Im Haus der Feinde","Golden Son","Filho Dourado","Ο χρυσός γιος","黄金の後継者 上","Filho dourado","Golden Son: Book II of the Red Rising Trilogy","Arany háború","Golden Son: Il segreto di Darrow","Gouden Zoon","O Filho Dourado","Furia aurie","Hijo dorado","黄金の後継者 下","Golden son [Spoken word] [MP3 CD].","Golden Son. Il segreto di Darrow","Golden Son - Putra Emas","Altın Oğul","Золотой Сын","Golden Son: Book II of the Red Rising Saga","Złoty syn","Sin Zlatnoga","Gyllene sonen","Zlatý syn","Red Rising - Livre 2 - Golden Son","Златен син"],"author_names":["Pierce Brown"],"book_category_id":1,"compilation":false,"content_warnings":["Death","Violence","War"],"contribution_specializations":[],"contribution_types":["Author"],"contributions":[{"author":{"id":232665,"image":{"color":"#acb2b8","color_name":"Pink","height":3512,"id":4661705,"url":"https://assets.hardcover.app/author/232665/5362292652538587.jpeg","width":2400},"name":"Pierce Brown","slug":"pierce-brown"},"contribution":"Author","contributor_role_id":1,"contributor_role_name":"Author","primary":true}],"cover_color":"Brown","description":"As a Red, Darrow grew up working the mines deep beneath the surface of Mars, enduring backbreaking labor while dreaming of the better future he was building for his descendants. But the Society he faithfully served was built on lies. Darrow’s kind have been betrayed and denied by their elitist masters, the Golds—and their only path to liberation is revolution. And so Darrow sacrifices himself in the name of the greater good for which Eo, his true love and inspiration, laid down her own life. He becomes a Gold, infiltrating their privileged realm so that he can destroy it from within.\n\nA lamb among wolves in a cruel world, Darrow finds friendship, respect, and even love—but also the wrath of powerful rivals. To wage and win the war that will change humankind’s destiny, Darrow must confront the treachery arrayed against him, overcome his all-too-human desire for retribution—and strive not for violent revolt but a hopeful rebirth. Though the road ahead is fraught with danger and deceit, Darrow must choose to follow Eo’s principles of love and justice to free his people.\n\nHe must live for more.","featured_series":{"collection":false,"details":"2","featured":true,"id":3043,"position":2.0,"series":{"books_count":14,"id":1033,"name":"Red Rising Saga","primary_books_count":6,"slug":"red-rising-saga"},"unreleased":false},"featured_series_position":2.0,"genres":["Science Fiction","Fantasy","Dystopian","Adventure","Young Adult","Science Fiction & Fantasy","adult","Dystopia","Action & Adventure","Jeunesse"],"has_audiobook":true,"has_ebook":true,"id":"378044","image":{"color":"#bd6007","color_name":"Brown","height":2485,"id":5472069,"url":"https://assets.hardcover.app/editions/30404982/b5150007-bf09-4937-8d32-ecf89f136342.jpg","width":1653},"isbns":["2017080446","9782017080442","1664411410","9781664411418","8525061484","9788525061485","618030193X","9786180301939","9791035412937","8525059544","9788525059543","0345539826","9780345539823","615552209X","9786155522093","8804673281","9788804673286","1399725564","9781399725569","9783946349652","1444759027","9781444759020","9024570980","9789024570980","9722357654","9789722357654","6068673359","9786068673356","0345539834","9780345539830","1444759035","9781444759037","8427208774","9788427208773","9024570999","9789024570997","4150120765","9784150120764","1444759043","9781444759044","0606394613","9780606394611","8490069255","9788490069257","1471290832","9781471290831","885207872X","9788852078729","3453534425","9783453534421","0345539818","9780345539816","1444759019","9781444759013","6020346315","9786020346311","6053437174","9786053437178","5389084608","9785389084605","1470380412","9781470380410","3641181984","9783641181987","836403068X","9788364030680","9798890550248","6053437182","9786053437185","9113061445","9789113061443","8027529239","9788027529230","2010003705","9782010003707","1594139199","9781594139192","8368069300","9788368069303","954281934X","9789542819349"],"li